      "options": {
        "content": "## Spend coverage\nSpend panels use the existing LiteLLM counters scraped into Mimir. The selected range and rolling seven-day totals include all gateway traffic and account for counter resets. Missing series display no data, not zero.\n\nCalls made directly to providers, including current embedding paths, are outside these totals. Run, corpus and lane attribution still require gateway call correlation; this dashboard does not offer filters that the metrics cannot apply. Per-request reported cost is available in the run trace, with estimates identified separately.",
